WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:14.030
<i>DOKI - Chihiro</i>

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:14.030
<i>DOKI</i>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.870
<b>fukigenna tenki moyou ga nori utsutteta aitsu</b>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.870
<b>不機嫌な天気模様が乗り移ってたアイツ</b>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.870
<b>That fellow was affected by bad weather</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>nanda! chotto naname ni sora wo miteta dake ka</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>なんだ！　ちょっとナナメに空を見てただけか</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>What! He's only squinting at the sky</b>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>shiritai (misetai)</b>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>知りたい（見せたい）</b>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>I want to know (I want to see)</b>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
<b>wakaritai (wakaranai)</b>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
<b>解りたい（解らない）</b>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
<b>I want to understand (I can't understand)</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>nakitai (nakenai)</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>泣きたい（泣けない）</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>soredemo</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>それでも</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>Even so,</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.440
Motto To LOVE-Ru 10

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.440
<u>Yami-Yami Fashion</u>

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.530
Hey, look!

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:39.490
Isn't she the girl who we always see at the school library?

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:40.450
You're right!

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.540
Who on earth is she? {TLC: nani mono: What type of person is she?}

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.750
Yami-chan!

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.000
Princess.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:47.750
Yuuki Rito.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.830
Are you going home from school?

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:50.960
Yep!

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.420
Yahoo! Yamiyami!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.130
You're so cute today too!

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.130
Eh?

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.930
I hate being petted like an animal.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.430
Yamiyami is so cold!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.720
But that's what makes her so cute!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.680
Yami-chan. What book are you reading today?

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:08.850
It's a book about clothes from Earth.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:10.440
Eh?

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.270
Mum designed these clothes.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.780
Really?

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.490
Rito, your mum is amazing!

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.030
She's quite famous overseas.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.160
Earth has such a large variety of clothes. I'm quite interested in it.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:29.210
Even though you say that, Yamiyami, you wear the same thing every day.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.040
Why don't you try out some clothes from Earth?

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.130
Yeah! That's a good idea.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.130
No thanks.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.880
I'm fine with this battle dress.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.180
It's decided! Let's go!

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.350
You didn't listen to me, did you?

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:45.010
We'll help you choose!

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.770
That sounds fun!

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.060
Let's go too, Rito, Haruna!

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:52.980
Me too?!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.530
Welcome!

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.110
Hey look! This is cute!

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:03.700
Ah, that's nice!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.160
What about this one?

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.660
How cute!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:15.630
Not only does this shop sell clothes, it sells underwear too!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.130
Yamiyami! Come over here!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.010
Alright, try this one first.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.180
OK.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.560
I can't wait!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.810
Yeah!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.830
Are you not ready yet, Yami-chan?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.700
Didn't she just go in?

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.080
Hey, are you ready yet, Yami-chan?

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:51.620
Idiot!

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.170
N-Not yet!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.730
Yamiyami! Are you OK this time?

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.600
Yes.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.490
How is it?

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.990
Yami-chan, you're so cute!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.410
But this looks a bit too boyish. {TLC}

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.660
Really?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.830
Then, how about...

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.630
Ouch...

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.210
Hey! How about this one?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.590
This is cute too!

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.590
Yami-chan, it suits you!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.970
It really suits you!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.600
But wouldn't it be better if it were something more normal?

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.100
I suppose.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.100
That one over there is cute!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.350
Where? Where?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.490
Is this alright?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.700
Yeah, absolutely!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.740
Hey, Yuuki, you say something as well.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.580
It's nice, isn't it?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.710
It suits you, a lot.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:19.920
Um...

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.590
Is it really alright for me to keep these clothes?

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.630
Yeah, it's fine! It's a present for you, Yamiyami.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.010
Thank you very much.{Yami's polite speech, so no abbrevs}

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.810
Isn't it great, Yami-chan?

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.640
Oh... There are so many cute girls here.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.350
Hey hey, you lot... Wanna play with us?

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:42.270
What do these fools from last century want?

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.780
And what of it? Let's play!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.860
This little girl is really cute, right?

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.740
Stop it!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.500
Who the hell are you?

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.210
I won't say anything bad.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.920
But you better stop before you get hurt!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.750
You looking for a fight?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.500
Er no, it's not like that!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.500
Yuuki-kun! {Timer's note: Doesn't she say Yuuki-kun?}{Yes she does lol}

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.340
Hey! Let go of Rito!

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.510
Princess.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.380
Please wait.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:15.020
That guy is my target.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.850
Do something to him and I will make you pay.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.730
Huh? What the hell are you saying?!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.480
And what will happen if we do something? Little girl.{Shorty?}

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.580
I already warned them that they were going to get hurt.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.830
What's wrong, Yamiyami?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.920
When I moved, the skirt...

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.500
Oh, that...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.920
I'll buy you another one.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.800
No, it's fine.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:49.880
I'm sorry. Even though you bought it for me...

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.470
Yami-chan...

00:06:55.010 --> 00:07:00.690
I guess my usual clothes suit me better after all. {TLC: itsumo no fuku}

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.620
In the end, she went back to wearing her usual clothes.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:21.540
That Yami... Has she already lost her interest in Earth clothing?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.040
I don't know about that!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.500
If you don't check, then you won't know for sure.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.090
Tadaa!

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.180
That's from back then...!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.190
Are you alright, Rito?

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.020
I hate perverts!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:58.040
Motto To LOVE-Ru 11

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:58.040
<u>Wonderful Love</u>

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.710
Stop running so fast, Maron!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.970
Again?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.140
Alright, I'll prescribe you some medicine. {TLC}

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:26.060
Thank you, Doctor Mikado.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.610
Take care!

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.210
So there are aliens like that, who pretend to be humans! {TLC}

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.580
How classic, wearing a costume.{TLC: kigurumi = Cartoon character costime?}{add a TL note? or TL it as a costume}

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.460
Oshizu-chan, you're living here?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.260
Yes! {something about her body}

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:56.430
Since she needs to give my artificial body maintenance, she allowed me to help her out.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.050
Even though she's a bit clumsy...

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.810
Yeah. I know.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:01.930
Anyway, Lala-san.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.310
Thanks for helping me with the medical supplies.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.190
It helped me out a lot.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.650
No problems. Zastin will be the one to prepare it.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.110
Oh yeah, since it's my break time,{hitokugiri = break}

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.690
I'll be off shopping, Sensei. {TLC}

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.650
Yes, if you please.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.200
See you, Rito-san, Lala-san.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.240
Take your time! {TLC: Go yukkuri = take it slow, take your time}

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.200
Okay.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:22.910
Um...

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:26.790
So this is a 100 yen coin. This is a 10 yen coin.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.250
Modern currency is so hard to deal with.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.550
A dog!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.220
Eh? Oshizu-chan?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.720
No! Don't come near me!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.720
Calm down! It's fine!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.060
Haruna-san?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.730
Someone was following you?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:55.360
Yes. Lately, I sense it whenever I take Maron for a walk.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.110
I have this bad feeling.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.530
Maybe it's a stalker?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.990
Who would stalk Sairenji...

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.620
Maybe it's the Headmaster?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.620
That might be true... How annoying.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:09.750
Anyway, let's all go and catch this stalker!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.290
Someone causing trouble for my friend...

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.380
It's unforgivable! {TLC}

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.220
If that's the case, I have a good idea!

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.390
Good idea?

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.930
An investigation using a decoy!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.470
I'll turn into you, Haruna,

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.220
and as a decoy, I'll catch the criminal!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.020
You'll turn into me?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.140
What do you mean?

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.060
By using that!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.770
Maru Maru Change-kun! {TLC: did i get this right?}

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:37.530
This machine allows two people to switch bodies!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.820
Allows two people to switch bodies?

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:42.620
You'll understand if you give it a go!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.830
Haruna, you go in there.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.700
Eh? OK...

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.230
Success!

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.730
Eh? I've turned into Lala-san.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:23.240
Eh? But Lala just went into that one, and Sairenji went into this one...

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.030
Eh?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:27.120
How is it, Rito? I swapped bodies with Haruna!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.000
I get it! No need to be so close! {TLC: Guess}{good guess}

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:34.130
Eh? Lala-san is Haruna-san and Haruna-san is Lala-san?

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:37.550
As usual, what an outrageous invention! {TLC: dunno what that word is}

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:47.060
Alright then, I'm going to take Maron for a walk, okay?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.850
Be careful, Lalana-san!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:50.310
"Lala" is fine.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.310
Maron-san too...

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:58.440
Will Lala-san be alright?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:02.490
She looks like Lala, but she's actually Haruna-chan!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.030
I'm a bit scared.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.120
It'll be fine!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.160
So cute!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.000
Eh? Why is my heart beating so fast?

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.090
Nothing showed up.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:22.630
I think it's better to stop already...

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.640
Eh? That's...

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.230
Lala hasn't noticed yet!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.400
Gotcha!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.940
Let me go!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.530
I lost in power?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.320
Oh yeah! This is Haruna's body.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.410
Please stop!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.490
Focus blast!{Willpower concentration!}{Telekinesis?}{nenriku shuuchuu}

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.330
What the hell is this?!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.750
I won't let you escape!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.460
Oh...

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.300
Lala-san, cover up!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.300
I'll repair it! {TLC}

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.180
I'm so sorry!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.890
I've had enough!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.050
Please stop!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.350
Alright. Time to explain yourself!

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.150
Why have you been following Sairenji?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:21.070
I never thought that an Earthling would have this kind of power. {TLC}

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.150
Earthling?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.360
I have no interest in women.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.780
I've fallen in love with...

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.160
...him.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.000
I beg of you... Please give him to me!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.800
No! Another dog!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:47.050
Oshizu-chan! Calm down!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:59.060
An assistant who increases the number of injured people isn't doing a good job.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.940
I'm... I'm sorry!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:12.780
Motto To LOVE-Ru 12

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:12.780
<u>Twins Escape</u>

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.160
They did it again?

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.990
They did it again.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.660
They should be on the Earth now. Find them and bring them back.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.210
It might be difficult.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.540
What are you saying, King Deviluke?

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:27.260
Compared to Lala-sama, those two princesses are nowhere as cute.{charming?}

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:31.350
Leave this to me, Zastin, leader of the royal guards! {this might need check up for consisency}

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:43.020
Rito. Can you go and prepare the bath?{fill the tub with water}

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.230
Alright.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.950
Someone's inside?

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.240
That's not possible.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.420
Eh?

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.510
Eh?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.970
Peeping tom! {TLC}

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.890
Nana! Momo!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.310
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.230
Hello, Sis.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.940
Are you alright?

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.320
Why were you two suddenly in the bathroom?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.650
Long time no see!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.440
Geez...

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.070
You should have let us know if you were going to come! {TLC}

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.860
We were in a rush, so...

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.240
In a rush?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.870
Er... Nothing...

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:44.330
Anyway, Onee-sama, has there been any progress towards your engagement with Rito? {TLC}

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:48.130
Like kissing... Or perhaps you've gone further?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.010
Eh? What?

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.470
You... What are you saying?!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.140
With that reaction... It seems they haven't done anything yet.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.850
K-K-Kiss?!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.100
How can you do something like that before you get married, Momo?!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:03.310
However, this is a guy who peeps while you have a bath. {TLC}

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.980
Peep? Rito?

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.520
Don't make me out as a peeping tom!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:10.900
Someone like that does not suit Sis.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:14.200
Ah. I don't feel that way though.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.490
Celine-chan and the others in the garden have also said,

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.750
Rito-san is a very warm and kind person.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.500
Celine and the reptiles?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.500
What do you mean?

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.920
Ah, Onee-sama never told you guys.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:36.140
I can communicate with plants and Nana with animals. {TLC: communicate?}{with telepathy}

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.140
Communicate with plants and animals?

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:43.310
On Deviluke, we're the only ones with this special power. {TLC}

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.270
Nana-sama, Momo-sama!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.520
Zastin!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.650
Come in through the front door!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.820
King Deviluke was in touch with me just now. {TLC}

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:56.450
He said that you two have left home because you don't want to study!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.870
Eh?

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.580
So that's how it is?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.790
That's because...

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.790
It's such a hassle.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.290
We've been stuck on the same topics for so long.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.710
For example, history of the universe, royal etiquette... {TLC: royal etiquette?}

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.380
Ah, I remember... {TLC}

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:15.010
When Lala-sama was younger, she often ran away from home. {TLC}

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:21.890
However... it took over ten years for the Deviluke King to end the greatest conflict in the universe.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.640
Learning about this era is very important.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.190
So...!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:28.480
Eh?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.150
Both of them have already escaped.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.940
Shit! After them!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.030
Yes sir!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:37.160
Those two are so troublesome! Leaving home and all...

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.120
Look who's talking.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:52.170
Damn! I forgot Zastin was on Earth.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.420
This happened because you wanted to leave home, Nana. {TLC}

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.090
What are you saying?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.840
Momo, didn't you agree to this?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.640
That's because you dragged me into it.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:06.560
It's happening again. You're pretending to be a good kid. {TLC}

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.020
It's like this every time. You're so crafty. {TLC}{sly?}

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:16.900
Oh well, every time people compare us, I am always the inferior one. It's understandable.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.200
Is that all you have to say?

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:31.710
Tail...

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.130
Tail!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.850
So you won't say things like this again,

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:49.270
should I teach your body how to behave?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.810
So...

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.610
From the position you're in, do you think you can retaliate?

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.440
I... can!{missing line}

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.200
Payback!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.340
Hey! Let me go!

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.250
You too!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.090
I've found you two!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.050
Peeping tom!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.060
You've got it wrong! {TLC}

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.730
Alright, the spaceship to take you two back has already been prepared. {TLC}

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.060
Come this way.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:35.270
Is it alright to approach them, Captain?

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.610
Even though they are princesses, their powers cannot be compared to ours. {TLC}

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:45.450
Their special abilities are to communicate with plants and animals. {TLC: Read the hearts/minds?}

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.290
It is totally useless in battle. {TLC}

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.120
I wouldn't say that, Zastin.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:56.210
We've been to many planets, and made a lot of friends.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.210
That's... Isn't that identical to Lala's?

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.800
I've stored their data inside. I can summon them any time. {TLC}

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.550
It's an invention of Lala's teleport system: The Dial.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.890
Let me show you... {TLC}

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:14.400
I met this on the Planet of the Wild Pigs. Giga Wild Boar, Gi-chan!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.740
No way!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.280
That's a dangerous beast! {TLC}

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.870
Sorry, Zastin-san!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.420
I accidentally called Shibarisugi-san from the planet of Okiwana. {TLC}{shibari means to bind. GIve it a name if you want}

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.670
They're over there!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.380
What the hell is going on?!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.220
No!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.640
Mikan!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.310
No! Let me go!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.230
Rito!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.940
Wait! I'm gonna save you now!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.900
Amazing!

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:05.660
The two of them are friends with such unusual animals and plants!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:13.660
King Deviluke.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.420
Incoming transmission from Zastin-sama. {TLC}

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.500
Connect it.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.750
Father!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:23.420
We'll be staying on Earth for the time being. {TLC}

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.300
Don't worry about us, Father!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.340
Sorry. I failed.

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:29.890
You useless piece of crap! {TLC}

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.770
So from now on, please take care of us.

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:38.230
Would Rito-san and Mikan-san mind if we stayed here for a while?

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:41.230
I won't say no, but...

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:44.940
We'll make a room in the attic and stay there. {TLC}

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.990
As for meals, baths, and the toilet, we'll figure out a way to deal with it in our own space. {TLC}

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:53.120
Sis, your lab can also be moved up there. {TLC}

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.120
That's a good idea!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.000
What should we do?

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>itsumo no jikan ni machiawasete</b>

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>いつもの時間に待ち合わせて</b>

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>I'm waiting for you at the usual time,</b>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:22.900
<b>chikoku shite terekakushi</b>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:22.900
<b>遅刻して照れ隠し</b>

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:22.900
<b>Hiding my embarrassment because I'm late.</b>

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:27.030
<b>damari komi kimete aruki dasuno</b>

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:27.030
<b>黙りこみ決めて歩き出すの</b>

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:27.030
<b>I walk beside you without saying a word.</b>

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:29.660
<b>share ni nattenai!</b>

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:29.660
<b>シャレになってない!</b>

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:29.660
<b>This joke is not funny.</b>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:36.120
<b>yume ni miteta koto konya kanai sou</b>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:36.120
<b>夢に見てたこと 今夜叶いそう</b>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:36.120
<b>What I saw in the dream might come true tonight.</b>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:42.170
<b>dakedo ne watashi kara janaku</b>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:42.170
<b>だけどね 私からじゃなく</b>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:42.170
<b>But you know, it shouldn't come from me.</b>

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:49.220
<b>anata no yuuki de kime naku cha</b>

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:49.220
<b>あなたの勇気でキメなくちゃ</b>

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:49.220
<b>I need you to pluck up the courage to decide.</b>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:56.390
<b>koishiteru kono kanji</b>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:56.390
<b>恋してる この感じ</b>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:56.390
<b>Falling in love... This feeling...</b>

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:04.110
<b>romanchikkuna yume wo misasete</b>

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:04.110
<b>ロマンチックな夢を見させて</b>

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:04.110
<b>Lets us witness romantic sweet dreams.</b>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:12.410
<b>koishiteru kono omoi kokoro kara</b>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:12.410
<b>恋してる この想い 心から</b>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:12.410
<b>Falling in love... This feeling in my heart...</b>

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:20.330
<b>afure dashiteru baby love</b>

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:20.330
<b>溢れ出してる baby love</b>

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:20.330
<b>...is overflowing with baby love.</b>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Preview

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Preview

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.890
Do you start eating a taiyaki from the head?

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.220
Or from the tail?

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.560
Eh? From the middle?

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.930
I hate that.
